[{"id":"zada-17-82-9","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"povećava","en":"he/it increases"},{"bs":"zaista ću vas povećati","en":"surely I will increase you (all)"},{"bs":"povećava ih","en":"he/it increases them"},{"bs":"pa ih je povećala","en":"so she/it increased them"}],"ref":"17:82","answerWord":"يَزِيدُ","answerSound":"audio/9195de46e4c49eb68817.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We reveal of the Qur'an that which is a healing and a mercy for believers though it increase the evil-doers in naught save ruin.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["وَنُنَزِّلُ","مِنَ","ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","مَا","هُوَ","شِفَآءٌ","وَرَحْمَةٌ","لِّلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","وَلَا","يَزِيدُ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ","إِلَّا","خَسَارًا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-47-17-2","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"povećao im je","en":"He increased them"},{"bs":"povećavate me","en":"you (all) increase me"},{"bs":"zaista ću vas povećati","en":"surely I will increase you (all)"},{"bs":"i povećava ih","en":"and he/it increases them"}],"ref":"47:17","answerWord":"زَادَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/70a155a567fc98cab7ac.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"While as for those who walk aright, He addeth to their guidance, and giveth them their protection (against evil).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","ٱهْتَدَوْا۟","زَادَهُمْ","هُدًى","وَءَاتَىٰهُمْ","تَقْوَىٰهُمْ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-4-173-7","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"i povećava ih","en":"and he/it increases them"},{"bs":"povećava","en":"he/it increases"},{"bs":"povećao im je","en":"He increased them"},{"bs":"i povećava vas","en":"and he/it increases you (all)"}],"ref":"4:173","answerWord":"وَيَزِيدُهُم","answerSound":"audio/8c07f675b4720a8d1d11.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then, as for those who believed and did good works, unto them will He pay their wages in full, adding unto them of His bounty; and as for those who were scornful and proud, them will He punish with a painful doom. And they will not find for them, against Allah, any protecting friend or helper.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["فَأَمَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَعَمِلُوا۟","ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ","فَيُوَفِّيهِمْ","أُجُورَهُمْ","وَيَزِيدُهُم","مِّن","فَضْلِهِۦ","وَأَمَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱسْتَنكَفُوا۟","وَٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","فَيُعَذِّبُهُمْ","عَذَابًا","أَلِيمًا","وَلَا","يَجِدُونَ","لَهُم","مِّن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَلِيًّا","وَلَا","نَصِيرًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-9-125-5","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih je povećala","en":"so she/it increased them"},{"bs":"povećavamo vas","en":"we increase you (all)"},{"bs":"pa ih je povećao","en":"so he/it increased them"},{"bs":"povećava ga","en":"he/it increases him"}],"ref":"9:125","answerWord":"فَزَادَتْهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/b704c9c87cfc8c433d9d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But as for those in whose hearts is disease, it only addeth wickedness to their wickedness, and they die while they are disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["وَأَمَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","فِى","قُلُوبِهِم","مَّرَضٌ","فَزَادَتْهُمْ","رِجْسًا","إِلَىٰ","رِجْسِهِمْ","وَمَاتُوا۟","وَهُمْ","كَٰفِرُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-17-41-7","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"povećava ih","en":"he/it increases them"},{"bs":"dodaj!","en":"add!"},{"bs":"(da mu) još dodam","en":"(that) I add more"},{"bs":"i povećao vas je","en":"and he/it increased you (all)"}],"ref":"17:41","answerWord":"يَزِيدُهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/647334ef2e4bcc0560df.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We verily have displayed (Our warnings) in this Qur'an that they may take heed, but it increaseth them in naught save aversion.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","صَرَّفْنَا","فِى","هَٰذَا","ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","لِيَذَّكَّرُوا۟","وَمَا","يَزِيدُهُمْ","إِلَّا","نُفُورًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-24-38-5","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"i povećava ih","en":"and he/it increases them"},{"bs":"povećavamo","en":"we increase"},{"bs":"povećala ih je","en":"she/it increased them"},{"bs":"povećala ga je","en":"she/it increased him"}],"ref":"24:38","answerWord":"وَيَزِيدَهُم","answerSound":"audio/5286a087218ea1b061b3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That Allah may reward them with the best of what they did, and increase reward for them of His bounty. Allah giveth blessings without stint to whom He will.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["لِيَجْزِيَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","أَحْسَنَ","مَا","عَمِلُوا۟","وَيَزِيدَهُم","مِّن","فَضْلِهِۦ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَرْزُقُ","مَن","يَشَآءُ","بِغَيْرِ","حِسَابٍ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-2-10-3","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih je povećao","en":"so he/it increased them"},{"bs":"pa ih je povećala","en":"so she/it increased them"},{"bs":"i povećava","en":"and he/it increases"},{"bs":"povećavamo","en":"we increase"}],"ref":"2:10","answerWord":"فَزَادَهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/1a6eb1a69f23aa927cb0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"In their hearts is a disease, and Allah increaseth their disease. A painful doom is theirs because they lie.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["فِى","قُلُوبِهِم","مَّرَضٌ","فَزَادَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","مَرَضًا","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌۢ","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَكْذِبُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-2-58-18","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"i povećat ćemo","en":"and we will increase"},{"bs":"pa ih je povećao","en":"so he/it increased them"},{"bs":"povećali su ih","en":"they increased them"},{"bs":"i povećava","en":"and he/it increases"}],"ref":"2:58","answerWord":"وَسَنَزِيدُ","answerSound":"audio/5f0fc27319cb21c56e3c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We said: Go into this township and eat freely of that which is therein, and enter the gate prostrate, and say: \"Repentance.\" We will forgive you your sins and will increase (reward) for the right-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قُلْنَا","ٱدْخُلُوا۟","هَٰذِهِ","ٱلْقَرْيَةَ","فَكُلُوا۟","مِنْهَا","حَيْثُ","شِئْتُمْ","رَغَدًا","وَٱدْخُلُوا۟","ٱلْبَابَ","سُجَّدًا","وَقُولُوا۟","حِطَّةٌ","نَّغْفِرْ","لَكُمْ","خَطَٰيَٰكُمْ","وَسَنَزِيدُ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-3-173-10","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih je povećao","en":"so he/it increased them"},{"bs":"povećali su vas","en":"they increased you (all)"},{"bs":"povećat ćemo","en":"we will increase"},{"bs":"i povećava","en":"and he/it increases"}],"ref":"3:173","answerWord":"فَزَادَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/4e2dc3dff5d877d7cf74.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those unto whom men said: Lo! the people have gathered against you, therefor fear them. (The threat of danger) but increased the faith of them and they cried: Allah is Sufficient for us! Most Excellent is He in Whom we trust!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","قَالَ","لَهُمُ","ٱلنَّاسُ","إِنَّ","ٱلنَّاسَ","قَدْ","جَمَعُوا۟","لَكُمْ","فَٱخْشَوْهُمْ","فَزَادَهُمْ","إِيمَٰنًا","وَقَالُوا۟","حَسْبُنَا","ٱللَّهُ","وَنِعْمَ","ٱلْوَكِيلُ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-7-69-18","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"i povećao vas je","en":"and he/it increased you (all)"},{"bs":"i zaista će povećati","en":"and surely he/it will increase"},{"bs":"povećava ga","en":"he/it increases him"},{"bs":"dodaj!","en":"add!"}],"ref":"7:69","answerWord":"وَزَادَكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/f1ab59251ddfc1dea5b0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Marvel ye that there should come unto you a Reminder from your Lord by means of a man among you, that he may warn you? Remember how He made you viceroys after Noah's folk, and gave you growth of stature. Remember (all) the bounties of your Lord, that haply ye may be successful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["أَوَعَجِبْتُمْ","أَن","جَآءَكُمْ","ذِكْرٌ","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","عَلَىٰ","رَجُلٍ","مِّنكُمْ","لِيُنذِرَكُمْ","وَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟","إِذْ","جَعَلَكُمْ","خُلَفَآءَ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","قَوْمِ","نُوحٍ","وَزَادَكُمْ","فِى","ٱلْخَلْقِ","بَصْۜطَةً","فَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟","ءَالَآءَ","ٱللَّهِ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تُفْلِحُونَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-7-161-18","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"povećat ćemo","en":"we will increase"},{"bs":"pa ih je povećao","en":"so he/it increased them"},{"bs":"povećavate me","en":"you (all) increase me"},{"bs":"i povećava ih","en":"and he/it increases them"}],"ref":"7:161","answerWord":"سَنَزِيدُ","answerSound":"audio/6826847ffa002d9455bd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when it was said unto them: Dwell in this township and eat therefrom whence ye will, and say \"Repentance,\" and enter the gate prostrate; We shall forgive you your sins; We shall increase (reward) for the right-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قِيلَ","لَهُمُ","ٱسْكُنُوا۟","هَٰذِهِ","ٱلْقَرْيَةَ","وَكُلُوا۟","مِنْهَا","حَيْثُ","شِئْتُمْ","وَقُولُوا۟","حِطَّةٌ","وَٱدْخُلُوا۟","ٱلْبَابَ","سُجَّدًا","نَّغْفِرْ","لَكُمْ","خَطِيٓـَٰٔتِكُمْ","سَنَزِيدُ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-8-2-12","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"povećala ih je","en":"she/it increased them"},{"bs":"povećao im je","en":"He increased them"},{"bs":"povećava ih","en":"he/it increases them"},{"bs":"povećava","en":"he/it increases"}],"ref":"8:2","answerWord":"زَادَتْهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/bc106b737e6cb76b7f65.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They only are the (true) believers whose hearts feel fear when Allah is mentioned, and when His revelations are recited unto them they increase their faith, and who trust in their Lord;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["إِنَّمَا","ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","إِذَا","ذُكِرَ","ٱللَّهُ","وَجِلَتْ","قُلُوبُهُمْ","وَإِذَا","تُلِيَتْ","عَلَيْهِمْ","ءَايَٰتُهُۥ","زَادَتْهُمْ","إِيمَٰنًا","وَعَلَىٰ","رَبِّهِمْ","يَتَوَكَّلُونَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-9-47-4","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"povećali su vas","en":"they increased you (all)"},{"bs":"i zaista će povećati","en":"and surely he/it will increase"},{"bs":"pa ga povećaj!","en":"so increase him!"},{"bs":"povećava ih","en":"he/it increases them"}],"ref":"9:47","answerWord":"زَادُوكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/feee0c47e3be6bd1a88d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Had they gone forth among you they had added to you naught save trouble and had hurried to and fro among you, seeking to cause sedition among you; and among you there are some who would have listened to them. Allah is Aware of evil-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["لَوْ","خَرَجُوا۟","فِيكُم","مَّا","زَادُوكُمْ","إِلَّا","خَبَالًا","وَلَأَوْضَعُوا۟","خِلَٰلَكُمْ","يَبْغُونَكُمُ","ٱلْفِتْنَةَ","وَفِيكُمْ","سَمَّٰعُونَ","لَهُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","عَلِيمٌۢ","بِٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-9-124-8","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"povećala ga je","en":"she/it increased him"},{"bs":"i povećao ga je","en":"and he/it increased him"},{"bs":"povećat ćemo","en":"we will increase"},{"bs":"povećavate me","en":"you (all) increase me"}],"ref":"9:124","answerWord":"زَادَتْهُ","answerSound":"audio/23c91a9298102b0b6117.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whenever a surah is revealed there are some of them who say: Which one of you hath thus increased in faith? As for those who believe, it hath increased them in faith and they rejoice (therefor).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","مَآ","أُنزِلَتْ","سُورَةٌ","فَمِنْهُم","مَّن","يَقُولُ","أَيُّكُمْ","زَادَتْهُ","هَٰذِهِۦٓ","إِيمَٰنًا","فَأَمَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","فَزَادَتْهُمْ","إِيمَٰنًا","وَهُمْ","يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-11-52-10","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"i povećava vas","en":"and he/it increases you (all)"},{"bs":"povećava ih","en":"he/it increases them"},{"bs":"dodaj!","en":"add!"},{"bs":"povećavamo","en":"we increase"}],"ref":"11:52","answerWord":"وَيَزِدْكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/fd04c171dd70ffdc2b5e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And, O my people! Ask forgiveness of your Lord, then turn unto Him repentant; He will cause the sky to rain abundance on you and will add unto you strength to your strength. Turn not away, guilty!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["وَيَٰقَوْمِ","ٱسْتَغْفِرُوا۟","رَبَّكُمْ","ثُمَّ","تُوبُوٓا۟","إِلَيْهِ","يُرْسِلِ","ٱلسَّمَآءَ","عَلَيْكُم","مِّدْرَارًا","وَيَزِدْكُمْ","قُوَّةً","إِلَىٰ","قُوَّتِكُمْ","وَلَا","تَتَوَلَّوْا۟","مُجْرِمِينَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-11-63-19","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"povećavate me","en":"you (all) increase me"},{"bs":"povećava","en":"he/it increases"},{"bs":"povećali su vas","en":"they increased you (all)"},{"bs":"i povećat ćemo","en":"and we will increase"}],"ref":"11:63","answerWord":"تَزِيدُونَنِى","answerSound":"audio/8e4b68a33851f57982b2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: O my people! Bethink you: if I am (acting) on clear proof from my Lord and there hath come unto me a mercy from Him, who will save me from Allah if I disobey Him? Ye would add to me naught save perdition.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["قَالَ","يَٰقَوْمِ","أَرَءَيْتُمْ","إِن","كُنتُ","عَلَىٰ","بَيِّنَةٍ","مِّن","رَّبِّى","وَءَاتَىٰنِى","مِنْهُ","رَحْمَةً","فَمَن","يَنصُرُنِى","مِنَ","ٱللَّهِ","إِنْ","عَصَيْتُهُۥ","فَمَا","تَزِيدُونَنِى","غَيْرَ","تَخْسِيرٍ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-11-101-21","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"povećali su ih","en":"they increased them"},{"bs":"i povećava ih","en":"and he/it increases them"},{"bs":"povećala ga je","en":"she/it increased him"},{"bs":"povećavamo","en":"we increase"}],"ref":"11:101","answerWord":"زَادُوهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/eaa662fc68d5d9125263.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We wronged them not, but they did wrong themselves; and their gods on whom they call beside Allah availed them naught when came thy Lord's command; they added to them naught save ruin.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["وَمَا","ظَلَمْنَٰهُمْ","وَلَٰكِن","ظَلَمُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","فَمَآ","أَغْنَتْ","عَنْهُمْ","ءَالِهَتُهُمُ","ٱلَّتِى","يَدْعُونَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","مِن","شَىْءٍ","لَّمَّا","جَآءَ","أَمْرُ","رَبِّكَ","وَمَا","زَادُوهُمْ","غَيْرَ","تَتْبِيبٍ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-14-7-5","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista ću vas povećati","en":"surely I will increase you (all)"},{"bs":"povećavamo","en":"we increase"},{"bs":"povećavate me","en":"you (all) increase me"},{"bs":"povećali su vas","en":"they increased you (all)"}],"ref":"14:7","answerWord":"لَأَزِيدَنَّكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/e973931e63776b00dba0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when your Lord proclaimed: If ye give thanks, I will give you more; but if ye are thankless, lo! My punishment is dire.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","تَأَذَّنَ","رَبُّكُمْ","لَئِن","شَكَرْتُمْ","لَأَزِيدَنَّكُمْ","وَلَئِن","كَفَرْتُمْ","إِنَّ","عَذَابِى","لَشَدِيدٌ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-17-109-3","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"i povećava ih","en":"and he/it increases them"},{"bs":"pa ih je povećao","en":"so he/it increased them"},{"bs":"i zaista će povećati","en":"and surely he/it will increase"},{"bs":"povećava ga","en":"he/it increases him"}],"ref":"17:109","answerWord":"وَيَزِيدُهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/9c5c81ac0a9f501d17d8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They fall down on their faces, weeping, and it increaseth humility in them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["وَيَخِرُّونَ","لِلْأَذْقَانِ","يَبْكُونَ","وَيَزِيدُهُمْ","خُشُوعًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"zada-19-76-0","words":["verb:zada"],"options":[{"bs":"i povećava","en":"and he/it increases"},{"bs":"i povećava ih","en":"and he/it increases them"},{"bs":"povećala ga je","en":"she/it increased him"},{"bs":"i povećat ćemo","en":"and we will increase"}],"ref":"19:76","answerWord":"وَيَزِيدُ","answerSound":"audio/a8d548befcba0a87aab1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah increaseth in right guidance those who walk aright, and the good deeds which endure are better in thy Lord's sight for reward, and better for resort.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati, dodati","en":"to increase, to add"},"passage":["وَيَزِيدُ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱهْتَدَوْا۟","هُدًى","وَٱلْبَٰقِيَٰتُ","ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتُ","خَيْرٌ","عِندَ","رَبِّكَ","ثَوَابًا","وَخَيْرٌ","مَّرَدًّا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"زادَ"}},{"id":"qaddara-74-19-2","words":["verb:qaddara"],"options":[{"bs":"odredio je","en":"he/it determined"},{"bs":"odredili smo","en":"we decreed"},{"bs":"odmjerili su ih","en":"they measured them"},{"bs":"odmjerava","en":"he/it measures"}],"ref":"74:19","answerWord":"قَدَّرَ","answerSound":"audio/c3d526d3546d22158454.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Self-)destroyed is he, how he planned!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odmjeriti, odrediti","en":"to measure, to determine"},"passage":["فَقُتِلَ","كَيْفَ","قَدَّرَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّرَ"}},{"id":"qaddara-25-2-17","words":["verb:qaddara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ga je odredio","en":"so he determined it"},{"bs":"i odredili smo","en":"and we determined"},{"bs":"odmjerava","en":"he/it measures"},{"bs":"i odmjeri","en":"and measure"}],"ref":"25:2","answerWord":"فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/d78179f53f305e80aa32.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He unto Whom belongeth the Sovereignty of the heavens and the earth, He hath chosen no son nor hath He any partner in the Sovereignty. He hath created everything and hath meted out for it a measure.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odmjeriti, odrediti","en":"to measure, to determine"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِى","لَهُۥ","مُلْكُ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَلَمْ","يَتَّخِذْ","وَلَدًا","وَلَمْ","يَكُن","لَّهُۥ","شَرِيكٌ","فِى","ٱلْمُلْكِ","وَخَلَقَ","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","تَقْدِيرًا"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّرَ"}},{"id":"qaddara-74-18-2","words":["verb:qaddara"],"options":[{"bs":"i odmjeravao je","en":"and he determined"},{"bs":"i odredili smo","en":"and we determined"},{"bs":"odmjerava","en":"he/it measures"},{"bs":"odredili smo ga","en":"we determined it"}],"ref":"74:18","answerWord":"وَقَدَّرَ","answerSound":"audio/47596837ee6d813c7adf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"For lo! he did consider; then he planned -","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odmjeriti, odrediti","en":"to measure, to determine"},"passage":["إِنَّهُۥ","فَكَّرَ","وَقَدَّرَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّرَ"}},{"id":"qaddara-10-5-7","words":["verb:qaddara"],"options":[{"bs":"i odredio ga je","en":"and he/it determined it"},{"bs":"odredili smo","en":"we decreed"},{"bs":"odredili smo ga","en":"we determined it"},{"bs":"odmjerava","en":"he/it measures"}],"ref":"10:5","answerWord":"وَقَدَّرَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/11f433ffc461816defc9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He it is Who appointed the sun a splendour and the moon a light, and measured for her stages, that ye might know the number of the years, and the reckoning. Allah created not (all) that save in truth. He detaileth the revelations for people who have knowledge.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odmjeriti, odrediti","en":"to measure, to determine"},"passage":["هُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","جَعَلَ","ٱلشَّمْسَ","ضِيَآءً","وَٱلْقَمَرَ","نُورًا","وَقَدَّرَهُۥ","مَنَازِلَ","لِتَعْلَمُوا۟","عَدَدَ","ٱلسِّنِينَ","وَٱلْحِسَابَ","مَا","خَلَقَ","ٱللَّهُ","ذَٰلِكَ","إِلَّا","بِٱلْحَقِّ","يُفَصِّلُ","ٱلْءَايَٰتِ","لِقَوْمٍ","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّرَ"}},{"id":"qaddara-15-60-2","words":["verb:qaddara"],"options":[{"bs":"odredili smo","en":"we decreed"},{"bs":"pa ga je odredio","en":"so he determined it"},{"bs":"odmjerili su ih","en":"they measured them"},{"bs":"i odmjeri","en":"and measure"}],"ref":"15:60","answerWord":"قَدَّرْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/c67d9bf407ead50dc857.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Except his wife, of whom We had decreed that she should be of those who stay behind.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odmjeriti, odrediti","en":"to measure, to determine"},"passage":["إِلَّا","ٱمْرَأَتَهُۥ","قَدَّرْنَآ","إِنَّهَا","لَمِنَ","ٱلْغَٰبِرِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّرَ"}},{"id":"qaddara-27-57-4","words":["verb:qaddara"],"options":[{"bs":"odredili smo je","en":"we destined her"},{"bs":"odmjerili su ih","en":"they measured them"},{"bs":"odmjerava","en":"he/it measures"},{"bs":"odredili smo","en":"we decreed"}],"ref":"27:57","answerWord":"قَدَّرْنَٰهَا","answerSound":"audio/b8428675e2baa25464da.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then We saved him and his household save his wife; We destined her to be of those who stayed behind.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odmjeriti, odrediti","en":"to measure, to determine"},"passage":["فَأَنجَيْنَٰهُ","وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ","إِلَّا","ٱمْرَأَتَهُۥ","قَدَّرْنَٰهَا","مِنَ","ٱلْغَٰبِرِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّرَ"}},{"id":"qaddara-34-11-3","words":["verb:qaddara"],"options":[{"bs":"i odmjeri","en":"and measure"},{"bs":"odmjerava","en":"he/it measures"},{"bs":"pa ga je odredio","en":"so he determined it"},{"bs":"odredili smo ga","en":"we determined it"}],"ref":"34:11","answerWord":"وَقَدِّرْ","answerSound":"audio/016b9ad3cdb0e8a6f6b2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Saying: Make thou long coats of mail and measure the links (thereof). And do ye right. Lo! I am Seer of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odmjeriti, odrediti","en":"to measure, to determine"},"passage":["أَنِ","ٱعْمَلْ","سَٰبِغَٰتٍ","وَقَدِّرْ","فِى","ٱلسَّرْدِ","وَٱعْمَلُوا۟","صَٰلِحًا","إِنِّى","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ","بَصِيرٌ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّرَ"}},{"id":"qaddara-34-18-9","words":["verb:qaddara"],"options":[{"bs":"i odredili smo","en":"and we determined"},{"bs":"odredio je","en":"he/it determined"},{"bs":"odredili smo ga","en":"we determined it"},{"bs":"i odredio ga je","en":"and he/it determined it"}],"ref":"34:18","answerWord":"وَقَدَّرْنَا","answerSound":"audio/fa8557156d1ba518602e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We set, between them and the towns which We had blessed, towns easy to be seen, and We made the stage between them easy, (saying): Travel in them safely both by night and day.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odmjeriti, odrediti","en":"to measure, to determine"},"passage":["وَجَعَلْنَا","بَيْنَهُمْ","وَبَيْنَ","ٱلْقُرَى","ٱلَّتِى","بَٰرَكْنَا","فِيهَا","قُرًى","ظَٰهِرَةً","وَقَدَّرْنَا","فِيهَا","ٱلسَّيْرَ","سِيرُوا۟","فِيهَا","لَيَالِىَ","وَأَيَّامًا","ءَامِنِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّرَ"}},{"id":"qaddara-36-39-1","words":["verb:qaddara"],"options":[{"bs":"odredili smo ga","en":"we determined it"},{"bs":"i odmjeri","en":"and measure"},{"bs":"i odredili smo","en":"and we determined"},{"bs":"odmjerava","en":"he/it measures"}],"ref":"36:39","answerWord":"قَدَّرْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/676c95fe79d5e5f2fc17.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And for the moon We have appointed mansions till she return like an old shrivelled palm-leaf.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odmjeriti, odrediti","en":"to measure, to determine"},"passage":["وَٱلْقَمَرَ","قَدَّرْنَٰهُ","مَنَازِلَ","حَتَّىٰ","عَادَ","كَٱلْعُرْجُونِ","ٱلْقَدِيمِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّرَ"}},{"id":"qaddara-56-60-1","words":["verb:qaddara"],"options":[{"bs":"odredili smo","en":"we decreed"},{"bs":"i odmjeri","en":"and measure"},{"bs":"i odredio ga je","en":"and he/it determined it"},{"bs":"i odmjeravao je","en":"and he determined"}],"ref":"56:60","answerWord":"قَدَّرْنَا","answerSound":"audio/3993e8c389da0d6c47dd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We mete out death among you, and We are not to be outrun,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odmjeriti, odrediti","en":"to measure, to determine"},"passage":["نَحْنُ","قَدَّرْنَا","بَيْنَكُمُ","ٱلْمَوْتَ","وَمَا","نَحْنُ","بِمَسْبُوقِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّرَ"}},{"id":"qaddara-76-16-3","words":["verb:qaddara"],"options":[{"bs":"odmjerili su ih","en":"they measured them"},{"bs":"odredili smo","en":"we decreed"},{"bs":"i odredio ga je","en":"and he/it determined it"},{"bs":"i odmjeravao je","en":"and he determined"}],"ref":"76:16","answerWord":"قَدَّرُوهَا","answerSound":"audio/e7814338054f37141a00.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Bright as) glass but (made) of silver, which they (themselves) have measured to the measure (of their deeds).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odmjeriti, odrediti","en":"to measure, to determine"},"passage":["قَوَارِيرَا۟","مِن","فِضَّةٍ","قَدَّرُوهَا","تَقْدِيرًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّرَ"}}]